<Cast cast="characters.cast" id="homeless_activities_part2" title="Activities for Part 2 of the Interdisciplinary Studies SBA on Homelessness" launchable="true">
<Vertical>

  <ActionButton id="print_homeless_part2_btn" label="Export as PDF">
    <PrintAction id="print_homeless_part2" />
  </ActionButton>

  <!-- ============================================================
       TASKSET 3: REFLECT - IS THIS INTERDISCIPLINARY?
       ============================================================ -->
  <Vertical id="homeless_taskset3">

   <IntakeGate ready="!@homeless_2_completion_page.value">
    <Markdown> </Markdown>
      <Vertical>
        <Image id="homeless_task_set_3_intro"
           src="/sba/interdisciplinary/images/the_thinker.jpg"
           height="400px"
           alt="Photograph of the Rodin sculpture, 'The Thinker' by Tammy Lo. CC by SA 2.0 Generic." />

        <!-- Repko's Broad Model -->
        <Vertical id="homeless_broad_model_display">
          <Markdown id="homeless_repko_criteria" src="readings/repko_criteria.md" />
        </Vertical>
      </Vertical>
    </IntakeGate>

    <Tabs id="homeless_first_pass_on_criteria">
      <Vertical id="homeless_first_pass_t1" title="My Evaluation">
        <Markdown>
**How well do you think the problem of homelessness fits Repko's criteria for an interdisciplinary study?**
        </Markdown>
        <TextArea id="hl_initial_repko_evaluation" placeholder="Your initial evaluation of how well homelessness fits Repko's criteria will go here ..." />
      </Vertical>
      <Vertical id="homeless_first_pass_t2" title="Repko's Criteria">
        <Use id="homeless_broad_model_display2" ref="homeless_repko_criteria" />
      </Vertical>
    </Tabs>

    <!-- Causes by disciplines mapping -->
    <Vertical id="homeless_causes_by_disciplines">
      <Markdown>
## Map Each Cause to Relevant Disciplines

**For each cause, select all disciplines that might study it.**
      </Markdown>
      <TabularMCQ id="hl_discipline_mapping">
        mode: checkbox
        cols: Biology, Psychology, Earth Science, Sociology, Economics, Political Science, Public Policy, Ethnography
        rows: Trauma / untreated mental health, Limited economic opportunity, Racial discrimination in housing, Limited access to cash assistance, Unsheltered exposure to extreme weather
      </TabularMCQ>
    </Vertical>

   <IntakeGate ready="!@homeless_2_completion_page.value">
    <Markdown> </Markdown>
      <!-- Display discipline mapping results -->
      <Vertical id="homeless_causes_by_disciplines_answers">
        <Markdown>
## Discipline Mapping Summary

Based on the team's analysis, here is how the causes map to disciplines:
        </Markdown>
        <Mermaid><![CDATA[
graph LR
    C1[Trauma /<br/>untreated mental health] --> D1[Psychology]
    C1 --> D2[Health Sciences]

    C2[Limited economic<br/>opportunity] --> D3[Economics]
    C2 --> D4[Sociology]

    C3[Racial discrimination<br/>in housing] --> D4
    C3 --> D5[Political Science]

    C4[Limited access to<br/>cash assistance] --> D5
    C4 --> D6[Public Policy]

    C5[Unsheltered exposure<br/>to extreme weather] --> D7[Earth Science]
    C5 --> D2

    style C1 fill:#e1f5ff
    style C2 fill:#e1f5ff
    style C3 fill:#e1f5ff
    style C4 fill:#e1f5ff
    style C5 fill:#e1f5ff
    style D1 fill:#fff4e1
    style D2 fill:#fff4e1
    style D3 fill:#fff4e1
    style D4 fill:#fff4e1
    style D5 fill:#fff4e1
    style D6 fill:#fff4e1
    style D7 fill:#fff4e1
]]></Mermaid>
        <Markdown>
This confirms that homelessness spans multiple disciplines, making it appropriate for interdisciplinary research.
        </Markdown>
      </Vertical>
    </IntakeGate>
  </Vertical>

  <!-- ============================================================
       TASKSET 4: REVIEW THE LITERATURE
       ============================================================ -->
  <Vertical id="homeless_taskset4">

   <!-- ===== Study 1: Economics (Cebula & Saunoris) ===== -->
   <IntakeGate ready="!@homeless_2_completion_page.value">
    <Markdown id="homeless_blank"> </Markdown>
    <Vertical id="homeless_econ_study_text" popout="window">
      <Markdown>
_Highlight the clue words or phrases that show what discipline or disciplines are relevant to this article. Then
click on the "Annotate" button and explain what discipline this clue suggests, and why._
      </Markdown>
      <Annotate id="homeless_econ_annotate" title="Determinants of Homelessness (Economics)" popout="window">
        <Markdown id="homeless_econ_study_md" src="readings/homeless_study_economics.md" />
      </Annotate>
    </Vertical>
   </IntakeGate>

    <Tabs id="homeless_econ_disciplines">
      <Vertical id="homeless_econ_disciplines_t1" title="Identify Relevant Disciplines">
        <Markdown>
**Which discipline(s) do you think are represented in this study?**
        </Markdown>
        <CheckboxInput id="hl_econ_disciplines">
          <Distractor id="hl_econ_bio">Biology</Distractor>
          <Distractor id="hl_econ_psych">Psychology</Distractor>
          <Distractor id="hl_econ_earth">Earth Science</Distractor>
          <Distractor id="hl_econ_soc">Sociology</Distractor>
          <Key id="hl_econ_econ">Economics</Key>
          <Distractor id="hl_econ_polisci">Political Science</Distractor>
          <Distractor id="hl_econ_policy">Public Policy</Distractor>
          <Distractor id="hl_econ_ethno">Ethnography</Distractor>
        </CheckboxInput>
      </Vertical>
      <Vertical id="homeless_econ_disciplines_t2" title="Economics Study">
        <Use ref="homeless_econ_study_text" />
      </Vertical>
    </Tabs>

    <Tabs id="homeless_econ_explanation">
      <Vertical id="homeless_econ_explanation_t1" title="Explain Discipline Clues">
        <Markdown>
**You selected the following disciplines:**
        </Markdown>
        <Use ref="hl_econ_disciplines" />
        <Markdown>
**Explain how the clues you highlighted indicate the disciplines you selected:**
        </Markdown>
        <TextArea id="hl_econ_classification_explanation" placeholder="The terms I highlighted indicate these disciplines because..." />
      </Vertical>
      <Vertical id="homeless_econ_explanation_t2" title="Economics Study">
        <Use ref="homeless_econ_study_text" />
      </Vertical>
    </Tabs>

    <Tabs id="homeless_econ_insight_input">
      <Vertical id="homeless_econ_insight_input_t1" title="Write Insight Sentence">
        <Markdown>
**Write your sentence for the insight of this source:**
        </Markdown>
        <TextArea id="hl_econ_insight_sentence" placeholder="The main disciplinary insight of this source is ..." />
      </Vertical>
      <Vertical id="homeless_econ_insight_input_t2" title="Economics Study">
        <Use ref="homeless_econ_study_text" />
      </Vertical>
    </Tabs>

    <Tabs id="homeless_econ_insight_choice">
      <Vertical id="homeless_econ_insight_choice_t1" title="Choose the Best Insight Sentence">
        <Markdown>
**Which of these sentences best expresses the insight of this source?**
        </Markdown>
        <ChoiceInput id="hl_econ_insight_choice_input">
          <Distractor>Homelessness is related to economic conditions like jobs and the labor market.</Distractor>
          <Key>Economic systems that create more job opportunities and labor-market flexibility are associated with lower homelessness.</Key>
          <Distractor>States should stop funding housing programs and promote entrepreneurship instead.</Distractor>
          <Distractor><Ref target="hl_econ_insight_sentence" /></Distractor>
        </ChoiceInput>
      </Vertical>
      <Vertical id="homeless_econ_insight_choice_t2" title="Economics Study">
        <Use ref="homeless_econ_study_text" />
      </Vertical>
    </Tabs>

    <Tabs id="homeless_econ_insight_explanation">
      <Vertical id="homeless_econ_insight_explanation_t1" title="Explain Your Choice">
        <Markdown>
**You chose the following sentence:**
        </Markdown>
        <Use ref="hl_econ_insight_choice_input" />
        <Markdown>
**Why did you select it? Explain.**
        </Markdown>
        <TextArea id="hl_econ_insight_explanation" placeholder="I chose this sentence because..." />
      </Vertical>
      <Vertical id="homeless_econ_insight_explanation_t2" title="Economics Study">
        <Use ref="homeless_econ_study_text" />
      </Vertical>
    </Tabs>

